{"version":1,"content":"<p>秋意漸濃，內地各地換上層林盡染的秋裝。</p><p>湖北武漢的兩江四岸與星羅湖泊被朝陽染金，水天一色。</p><p>遊客迎風漫步，盡顯江城生態宜居的詩意風光。</p><p>（新華社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T02:01:29.449137+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":73,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T01:30:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T22:58:07.258307+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T01:58:25.404828+00:00","content_hash":"b261108df04b404fb0d2d922e5f4dd24962c164593764f36f024fd51ff84fd4c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}